      "root": "book",
      "text": "# Contract record for 0522/05.18\n\nThe pack remains `state: PREPARED; execute on Director handoff; final bounded pass tonight` until Prime reviews the return. This evidence does not select the app.\n\nThe successor is `labs/review-loop-convergence-pass02`. It loads the frozen pass01 workbook by absolute pin and observes that chain. The pass01 lab, its candidate, its return, and the active app stay at",
