      "encoding": "utf-8",
      "path": "0522.review-construction/evidence/build05.18/FAILURES.md",
      "role": "artifact",
      "root": "book",
      "text": "# First failures retained\n\nThese are the failures this successor was required to preserve. The passing author suite does not erase them. Historical modules were not edited.\n\n1. The unmodified `labs/review-loop-convergence-pass01` author suite stops in `fresh_app` because the filed 05.17 pointer is no longer PENDING. It also expects the Review section to stay PENDING. That expectation fails after a",
