      "path": "0522.review-construction/evidence/build05.18/INTEGRATION.md",
      "role": "artifact",
      "root": "book",
      "text": "# Code path\n\nThe generated `candidate/app/librarian.py` loads two doors from the candidate root.\n\n- `review-loop` calls `labs/review-loop-convergence-pass02/review_loop_tools.py`. The door refuses a declaration whose workbook path is anything other than `labs/review-loop-convergence-pass02/workbook.py`, then runs that file. Fixture commands and unknown commands refuse. A missing door refuses. Ther",
      "truncated": true
    },
    {
      "encoding": "utf-8",
      "path": "0522.review-construction/evidence/build05.18/PINS.md",
      "role": "artifact",
      "root": "book",
      "text": "# Pins for the unselected convergence successor\n\nHelper root is `D:\\Git\\lib-build`. The candidate root is `D:\\librarian\\temp\\0522-0518-report\\candidate`. The candidate is unselected. R and W stay pending.\n\n## Active surface, unchanged\n\n- `app/librarian.py` sha256 `c3a5be3b612c021d95effaa5da4a151bf89026422b94f4cad98331014c7f0cd9`, 12204 bytes\n- `app/README.md` sha256 `3c2125aa0cebd7ddc1604de2a823c1",
