      "encoding": "utf-8",
      "path": "0522.review-construction/evidence/build05.18/PRIME-USE.md",
      "role": "artifact",
      "root": "book",
      "text": "# PRIME-USE\n\nRerun the author suite with Python 3.14, `python -B`, and `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`:\n\n`python -B labs/review-loop-convergence-pass02/tests/test_convergence.py`\n\nThe passing log in this directory is the builder's run, not an independent Prime run. The external root `D:\\librarian\\temp\\0522-0518-report` may be recreated by that command. The command also rewrites the generated lab doors",
      "truncated": true
