      "role": "artifact",
      "root": "book",
      "text": "# Reconstruction\n\nFrom `D:\\Git\\lib-build`, with `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`:\n\n1. `python -B labs/review-loop-convergence-pass02/make_candidate.py --output <empty directory outside D:\\Git\\lib-build>` writes a new root. It refuses an existing output and it refuses an output inside the repo. It refuses unless `app/librarian.py` is still sha256 `c3a5be3b612c021d95effaa5da4a151bf89026422b94f4cad9833101",
